  data: {
    LLM: 'The game is a point-trick game with bidding. Players bid to determine who plays alone against the other two. The bidder must capture at least 3 of the 5 available points (the four aces and the last trick). Cards are played in tricks with no trumps. Players must follow suit if possible. Highest card of led suit wins the trick. Winner leads to next trick.',
    Player: 'The game is a point-trick game with bidding. Players bid to determine who plays alone against the other two. The bidder must capture at least 3 of the 5 available points (the four aces and the last trick). Cards are played in tricks with no trumps. Players must follow suit if possible. Highest card of led suit wins the trick. Winner leads to next trick.',
    objective: 'Capture aces (worth 1 point each) and win the last trick (worth 1 point). Total 5 points per hand. First to 11 or 21 points wins the game.',
